DESCRIPTION:https://sf.funcheap.com/history-motion-free-grand-opening-cele
 bration-san-mateo-county-history-museum/\nLocation: peninsula\nPrice: Free
 \nCategories: community\, free\nSource: funcheap/peninsula\n\nHISTORY IN M
 OTION: A Day of Discovery for the Whole Family Bring the whole family to t
 he San Mateo County History Museum on Saturday\, November 7\, for HISTORY 
 IN MOTION\, a FREE Grand Opening Celebration filled with history\, music\,
  discovery and fun! Be among the first to explore three exciting new exper
 iences: discover historic carriages and automobiles in the Taube Family Ca
 rriage House and Automobile Gallery\, travel millions of years into the Pe
 ninsula’s past in the H.E.R.O. Natural History Gallery\, and step inside
  the beautifully restored Lora Mundi House\, formerly the Lathrop-Connor-M
 ansfield House. Kids and families can enjoy hands-on activities throughout
  the Museum Campus\, meet Museum experts\, discover fascinating stories fr
 om the Peninsula’s past and experience history brought to life. Explore 
 the new galleries\, enjoy live music and family-friendly programs\, and jo
 in us for the 11 a.m. ceremonial ribbon cutting as the Museum celebrates i
 ts $25.5 million transformation. Saturday\, November 7 | 10 a.m.-2 p.m. Sa
 n Mateo County History Museum | 2200 Broadway\, Redwood City FREE admissio
 n Come curious. Bring the family. Discover history in motion!
LOCATION:peninsula
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/history-motion-free-grand-opening-celebration-
 san-mateo-county-history-museum/
END:VEVENT
